('anna-karenina','en','a0cc1fced88174e0eed87bf3e1507fc06defe86fb2a54777e3bd9263073df2c7','The point locates Yasnaya Polyana, the documented real inspiration for Levin’s fictional Pokrovskoye. It does not identify the fictional estate or assign real addresses to its buildings.','The point locates Yasnaya Polyana, the documented real inspiration for Levin’s fictional Pokrovskoye. It does not identify the fictional estate or assign real addresses to its buildings.'),
