('anna-karenina','fr','a0cc1fced88174e0eed87bf3e1507fc06defe86fb2a54777e3bd9263073df2c7','The point locates Yasnaya Polyana, the documented real inspiration for Levin’s fictional Pokrovskoye. It does not identify the fictional estate or assign real addresses to its buildings.','Le point situe Iasnaïa Poliana, inspiration réelle documentée du domaine fictif de Lévine à Pokrovskoïé. Il n’identifie pas le domaine du roman et n’attribue pas d’adresses réelles à ses bâtiments.'),
('anna-karenina','es','a0cc1fced88174e0eed87bf3e1507fc06defe86fb2a54777e3bd9263073df2c7','The point locates Yasnaya Polyana, the documented real inspiration for Levin’s fictional Pokrovskoye. It does not identify the fictional estate or assign real addresses to its buildings.','El punto sitúa Yásnaya Poliana, inspiración real documentada de la finca ficticia Pokróvskoye de Levin. No identifica la finca de la novela ni asigna direcciones reales a sus edificios.'),
