('sound-and-fury','en','423baa9842c1b9d301afe235b025a53aa14c447bf8b81c08da8a3b35e70020f8','The point locates Oxford, Mississippi, the documented real inspiration for fictional Jefferson. The two towns are distinct in Faulkner’s fiction. No Oxford building or address is identified with a fictional Jefferson setting.','The point locates Oxford, Mississippi, the documented real inspiration for fictional Jefferson. The two towns are distinct in Faulkner’s fiction. No Oxford building or address is identified with a fictional Jefferson setting.'),
('sound-and-fury','it','423baa9842c1b9d301afe235b025a53aa14c447bf8b81c08da8a3b35e70020f8','The point locates Oxford, Mississippi, the documented real inspiration for fictional Jefferson. The two towns are distinct in Faulkner’s fiction. No Oxford building or address is identified with a fictional Jefferson setting.','Il punto localizza Oxford, Mississippi, ispirazione reale documentata della città immaginaria Jefferson. Le due città restano distinte nella narrativa di Faulkner. Nessun edificio o indirizzo di Oxford è identificato con un’ambientazione immaginaria di Jefferson.'),
('sound-and-fury','fr','423baa9842c1b9d301afe235b025a53aa14c447bf8b81c08da8a3b35e70020f8','The point locates Oxford, Mississippi, the documented real inspiration for fictional Jefferson. The two towns are distinct in Faulkner’s fiction. No Oxford building or address is identified with a fictional Jefferson setting.','Le point situe Oxford, Mississippi, inspiration réelle documentée de la ville fictive de Jefferson. Les deux villes restent distinctes dans la fiction de Faulkner. Aucun bâtiment ni adresse d’Oxford n’est identifié à un lieu fictif de Jefferson.'),
('sound-and-fury','es','423baa9842c1b9d301afe235b025a53aa14c447bf8b81c08da8a3b35e70020f8','The point locates Oxford, Mississippi, the documented real inspiration for fictional Jefferson. The two towns are distinct in Faulkner’s fiction. No Oxford building or address is identified with a fictional Jefferson setting.','El punto sitúa Oxford, Misisipi, inspiración real documentada de la ciudad ficticia Jefferson. Ambas ciudades siguen siendo distintas en la ficción de Faulkner. Ningún edificio ni dirección de Oxford se identifica con un escenario ficticio de Jefferson.'),
